// ReconcileService — correctness backstop for branch reachability.
//
// Plan §"ReconcileService" — single queue entrypoint, three triggers
// (periodic, on-read drift, on-write failure), shared throttle per
// (repo_id, branch).
//
// The reconciler is stateless: read GitSource branch HEAD, listDAG(branch),
// diff against repo_branch_commits, write the diff (insert reachable
// rows, delete unreachable in window), update last_reconciled_at +
// last_known_head_sha. No cursor, no resume, no history_complete —
// force-pushes and rebases produce the right state via DAG diff naturally.

