 * message runs those compares 4-wide (COMPARE_CONCURRENCY) and holds one of
 * only 2 repo-sync queue slots (wrangler `max_concurrency`) for the full
 * upstream-fetch duration — the head-of-line blocking that backs the queue up
 * on big repos.
